 beaches. Your drives will be unlike any other. You can also enjoy the stunning island of Ibiza: weave through the heart of Dalt Vila, spend time along the city\u2019s docks, or escape onto wilder trails.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cComplete your collection\u201d</h2>Acquire iconic models from the world\u2019s greatest manufacturers: Ferrari, Lamborghini, Porsche, Bugatti, Koenigsegg, Aston Martin, and many more\u2026 More than 120 cars from 30 brands are represented, from 1960s daily drivers to ultra-modern hypercars and even off-road vehicles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cShine in the eyes of other players\u201d</h2>Shape your avatar in your own image and become a key figure: craft your outfits using the various boutiques, then meet other players in social hubs such as the Solar Hotel, the Casino with its slot machines and poker tables, or car dealerships. These are perfect places to meet others and enjoy the Test Drive Unlimited Solar Crown experience together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cA wide variety of activities\u201d</h2>Stay alert and explore all available activities: in addition to classic game modes like races, off-road races, and time trials, discover more unique gameplay such as vehicle deliveries and Taxi missions. Be sure to join the weekly events as well\u2014they\u2019ll reward you with exclusive prizes.<br><br><strong>Key Features\t</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Live the ultimate Test Drive Unlimited experience: unparalleled lifestyle elements and driving experience.<br></li><li>Explore hyper-realistic 1:1 scale recreations of Hong Kong Island and the sunny landscapes of Ibiza.<br></li><li>Collect over 120 iconic cars, from timeless classics to modern hypercars.<br></li><li>Create your unique avatar and become a social icon in vibrant player hubs.<br></li><li>Experience endless adventure with diverse activities and fresh weekly events.</li></ul>","developers":["KT Racing"],"dlc":[2515670,2515680,2515690,2515700],"ext_user_account_notice":"MyNaco